                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.26603/2611.26603v1/architecture.png",
                "caption": "Figure 3:Depth Pro 2 Architecture.Our depth estimation network consists of a multi-view transformer that ingests one or multiple input frames and processes them jointly, and a DPT decoder, which predicts an inverse depth map per input frame.1The transformer alternates attention within and across frames.2Features for fusion by the DPT decoder are extracted at intermediate layers. Table1details layer configurations for each model of the Depth Pro 2 family.",
